编几个名字呢?这样我们可以进行民用波段谈话,好吗?
and we'll talk CB talk, all right?

137
00:08:52,260 --> 00:08:54,580
本:待会也许可以.我不想这么快就过于兴奋.
Ben: Maybe later; I don't want to peak too soon.

138
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,300
杰森:你想起个什么头衔呢?
Jason: What do you want your handle to be?

139
00:08:56,940 --> 00:08:58,080
本:长头发之子.
Ben: Son of big hair.

140
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:08,880
卢克:你午饭没怎么吃.
Luke: You haven't touched your lunch.

141
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:17,200
乔治:哦,你迈克哥哥把菜推的老远,我够不着.谢谢.卢克?
George: Well, your buddy Mike keeps putting it just out of reach.Thank you.Luke?

142
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,500
卢克:什么?
Luke: What?

143
00:09:21,420 --> 00:09:22,160
乔治:高中上的怎么样?
George: How's high school?

144
00:09:22,700 --> 00:09:23,700
卢克:你为什么想了解?
Luke: Why do you want to know?

145
00:09:24,220 --> 00:09:25,940
乔治:我从没进一个高中看一眼.
George: I never saw one from the inside.

146
00:09:28,060 --> 00:09:28,100
卢克:是啊.哦,我们很多人有艰苦的休息时间.
Luke: Yeah.Well, a lot of us have had tough breaks.

147
00:09:28,100 --> 00:09:30,400
乔治:打球吗?
George: Playing balls?

148
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:32,500
卢克:我还有事要做.
Luke: I think I've thing to do.

149
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:36,500
乔治:啊,求你了,卢克,求……哦,
George: Aw, come on, Luke, come...

150
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:44,300
告诉我,上帝,我该怎么接近自己的儿子.
Please, God, tell me how to get through to my son.

151
00:09:45,220 --> 00:09:46,800
迈克:你,呃,你跟别人讲话吗,乔治?
Mike: You, uh, you talking to somebody, George?

152
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:48,500
乔治:哦!(笑)不,不,只是,呃,用嘴巴思考.
George: Oh!(laughing) No, no.Just, uh, thinking with my mouth.

153
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:54,240
有人说下巴上的肌肉是整个身体上最强壮的,但,
You know they say the jaw muscles is the strongest in the whole body,

154
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:58,320
呃,在路上独自颠簸了25年后,它变成了最没用的肌肉了.
but, uh, after 25 years on the road, I say it's the gluteus maximus.

155
00:09:58,700 --> 00:09:59,960
就像拉丁语说的"废物".
That's Latin for "big butt."

156
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:06,500
迈克:是的,是的,我懂.我教法语.哦,嘿,来吧,乔治.我们得去,呃,得去拍片子.
Mike: Yeah, yeah, I know.I teach French.Well, hey, come on, George.We gotta get going and, uh, get those X-rays.

157
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:10,800
乔治:哎呀!哎呀!不用.我感觉好多了.
George: Ow!Ow!No need.I'm feeling much better.

158
00:10:13,980 --> 00:10:15,580
迈克:是的,对,对.
Mike: Yeah, right, right.

159
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:18,880
你知道,乔治,
You know, George, you really should have said that you had something that

160
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:22,360
你真的早应该说你身上有什么毛病拍片很难看出来,比方说长疮,
wouldn't show up on an X-ray, like, uh, whiplash, or, uh,

161
00:10:22,420 --> 00:10:23,500
得鸡眼,有口腔溃疡什么的.
hoof and mouth disease.

162
00:10:24,780 --> 00:10:27,240
乔治:第一次见面的坏印象让你念念不忘,是吗?
George: That bad first impression burned you deep, didn't it?

163
00:10:27,640 --> 00:10:29,240
迈克:对此念念不忘的是卢克.
Mike: Not half as deeply as it burned Luke.

164
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:38,800
乔治:那么我明白了,迈克.
George: So I see.Mike, I spent 25 thousand miles thinking about it.

165
00:10:39,900 --> 00:10:42,800
我走了25000英里的路在考虑这个问题.卢克是我的亲骨肉,
The thing is, Luke is my blood.

166
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:46,740
我自己就是想去了解父亲的时候已经太晚了.
I never got to know my dad until it was too late.

167
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:48,720
我不想让卢克也这样.
I don't want that to happen to Luke.

168
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:52,340
麦琪:是的,谢谢你来电话.
Maggie: Yes, thank you for calling.

169
00:10:53,980 --> 00:10:55,560
迈克:我真不敢相信这个乔治.
Mike: I can't believe this George.

170
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:57,680
装着受伤而让让卢克感动.
Pretending he's hurt to get on Luke's good side.

171
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:59,600
麦琪:他不是假装的,迈克.
Maggie: He's not pretending, Mike.

172
00:10:59,600 --> 00:10:59,700
迈克:什么?
Mike: What?

173
00:11:01,420 --> 00:11:04,120
麦琪:刚才是克莱默医生.他跟乔治的医生谈过了.
Maggie: That was Dr.Kramer.He's spoken to George's doctor.

174
00:11:05,220 --> 00:11:07,660
乔治的背已经恶化了.如果他不停止开车的话,
George's back has deteriorated to the point,

175
00:11:07,660 --> 00:11:11,820
他就会瘫痪的.
where if he doesn't stop driving his truck, he's going to be paralyzed.

176
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:21,700
