George: The doctors call it cervical deterioration.

177
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:24,400
我认为就是脖子老疼.
I call it a pain in the neck.

178
00:11:26,580 --> 00:11:28,160
迈克:那,你不开车会干什么呢?
Mike: Well, what are you gonna do when you stop driving?

179
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:32,280
迈克:乔治,医生说如果你不停止,你会瘫痪的.
Mike: George, the doctors say if you don't, you're going to be paralyzed.

180
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:33,080
乔治:啊,
George: Aw, they don't know nothin'.

181
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:36,580
他们什么都不懂.他们告诉我的朋友比利·鲍伯还有3个半月时间好活,
They told my friend Billy Bob he had 3-1/2 months to live.

182
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:37,160
可他活了4个半月.
He lived 4-1/2 months.

183
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:44,140
迈克:乔治,换工作就这么难吗?
Mike: George, what's so hard about changing jobs?

184
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,920
乔治:凭8年级的教育程度,我能干什么?
George: With an eighth grade education?

185
00:11:46,620 --> 00:11:48,380
也许我可以当个大法官.
Maybe I could be a supreme court justice.

186
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:54,900
我只知道三件事:卡车,卡车和卡车.
I only know three things; that's trucks, trucks, and trucks.

187
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:59,280
迈克:哦,我相信你可以得到其他的工作.
Mike: Well, I'm sure there's other jobs you could get, that, uh, you know,

188
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:00,380
呃,你知道,你还可以围绕卡车找工作啊.
you could still be around trucks.

189
00:12:00,580 --> 00:12:01,380
乔治:比方说?
George: Like what?

190
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:05,800
迈克:哦,我不知道.
Mike: Well, I don't know.You could, uh, you could lease big rigs.

191
