George: Those aren't sold; they're handed down from generation to generation.

195
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,920
迈克:那么,你什么时候告诉卢克这事?
Mike: So, when are you gonna tell Luke?

196
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:24,600
乔治:卢克不该知道这事.我不要他的可怜.我只是想要个更好了解他的机会.
George: Luke is to know nothing about this.I don't want his pity.I just want a chance to get to know him better.

197
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:29,500
本:三个小时的行程.他们是在骗傻子呢.
Ben: A three hour trip.That's what they told Gilligan.

198
00:12:34,220 --> 00:12:35,980
杰森:好了,看来我们有点迷路了.
Jason: Okay, so we got a little lost.

199
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:39,260
本:有点迷路!爸爸,
Ben: A little lost!Dad, we were halfway to Florida!

200
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:42,980
我们都快到佛罗里达了!如果不是在那家加油站停下来的话,我们现在都到古巴了.
If we hadn't stopped at that gas station, we'd be in Cuba by now.

201
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:45,740
杰森:好了,现在我们走上正确的道路了.
Jason: Well, we're going the right way, now.

202
00:12:45,820 --> 00:12:47,580
那个仓库就在路前面半英里的地方.
The depot's a half a mile down the road.

203
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:49,820
本:爸爸,都7点半了.
Ben: Dad, it's 7:30!

204
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:53,340
如果他们2分钟卸完车,
If they unload the truck in two minutes,

205
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:56,980
而且如果我们以没小时195英里的速度回到家,
and if we drive 195 miles per hour back home,

206
00:12:57,100 --> 00:13:00,140
我才可以赶上那个晚会的最后5分钟.
I might actually be able to catch the last five minutes of that party.

207
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:01,380
杰森:能这样就好了.
Jason: Could be worse.

208
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:05,460
本:正确.你还可以唱一唱威利·纳尔逊的歌呢.
Ben: True.You could still be singing those Willy Nelson songs.

209
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,280
杰森:好了,仓库到了.
Jason: Ah, here's the depot right up here.

210
