212
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:24,020
仓库工人:拉到19号码头,伙计.
Depot worker: Pull 'er into dock 19, Johnny.

213
00:13:24,020 --> 00:13:26,600
杰森:(唱歌)好的,太好了.我说,他们能马上卸车呢?
Jason: (sighing) All right, great.Listen, these guys are gonna unload us right away?

214
