00:13:41,700 --> 00:13:47,900
迈克和卢克:(唱歌)……拉下孤独老流浪汉的面具,你不在吉姆身上浪费时间.
Mike and Luke:  (singing)...pull the mask off the old Lone Ranger, and you don't mess around with Jim.

217
