卢克:看看这张照片.我是不是很像她?
Luke: Check out this picture.Don't I look a lot like her?

221
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:02,800
迈克:哦,是的.哦,嘿,乔治看起来真年轻.你笑起来跟他一样,你知道吗?
Mike: Oh, yeah, gosh.Hey, George looks so young here.You got his smile, you know it?

222
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:04,700
卢克:不,我没看出来.
Luke: Nah, I don't see it.

223
00:14:04,700 --> 00:14:09,800
迈克:嘿,卢克,呃,我想跟你说件事.哦,我真的不想,可……
Mike: Hey, Luke, uh, I want to talk to you about something.Well, I really don't, uh...

224
00:14:14,500 --> 00:14:16,560
卢克:迈克,如果你想跟我谈生活的真谛,
Luke: Mike, if you're trying to talk about the facts of life,

225
