呃,这全是我的错.我真的很抱歉.
uh, it's all my fault, and I am truly sorry.

237
00:15:07,460 --> 00:15:08,200
本:我很开心,爸爸.收到了吗,伙计?
Ben: I had a great time, dad.Copy, good buddy?

238
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:13,500
杰森:10-4.(笑)哦,我们收拾停当,向家开拔.
Jason: 10-4.(laughing) Well, let's hammer down, and head for home!

239
00:15:13,500 --> 00:15:27,600
本:(拉绳索)好啊!
Ben: (pulling horn cord) Yee-hah!

240
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:30,300
乔治:(呻吟)我不是故意吵醒你的.
George: (groaning) I didn't mean to wake you up.

241
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:35,700
卢克:你在干什么?
Luke: What are you doing?

242
