乔治:我只是在挪我这把老骨头到厕所去方便.
George: Just trying to get this old body to the bathroom and pay the toll.

243
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:43,440
卢克:哦,你一定很疼吧.
Luke: Oh, you must really be in pain.

244
