卢克:来,让我罢帮你.
Luke: Here.Let me help you up.

246
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:56,800
乔治:好的,我来了.我马上就到了.(笑)
George: Ok, I'm coming.I'll be right there.(laughing)

247
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:02,160
卢克:怎么这么乐啊?
Luke: What's so funny?

248
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:06,060
乔治:哦,
George: Well, when you were a little boy,

249
00:16:06,300 --> 00:16:08,980
你小的时候,我经常半夜带你上厕所,
I used to take you to the bathroom in the middle of the night so that

250
00:16:08,980 --> 00:16:09,880
这样你就不会尿床了.
you wouldn't wet the bed,

251
00:16:09,920 --> 00:16:13,000
