254
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:23,600
(唱)你不拽超人的斗篷,你不向风里吐口水……
(singing) You don't tug on Superman's cape, you don't spit into the wind....

255
00:16:28,420 --> 00:16:30,380
卢克:是的!妈妈经常给我唱这首歌.
Luke: Yeah!Mom used to sing that to me.

256
00:16:30,380 --> 00:16:33,220
乔治:卢克!你妈妈是个可爱的女人,
George: Luke!Your mom was a lovely woman,

257
00:16:33,220 --> 00:16:38,820
可她唱歌老跑调.你还记得吗?
but she couldn't carry a tune in a bucket.Don't you remember?

258
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:43,340
你最害怕柜子里的那些妖怪了.(唱)你不拉下孤独老流浪汉的面具,
You were terrified of all those monsters in the closet.(singing) You don't

259
00:16:43,340 --> 00:16:45,200
你不在吉姆身上浪费时间……
pull the mask off the old Lone Ranger, and you don't mess around with....

260
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:53,400
卢克:卢克.那就是你.
Luke: Luke.It was you.

261
00:16:57,800 --> 00:16:59,180
乔治:你特别喜欢听.这样你就觉得自己比那些怪物更大,
George: You loved it.

262
00:17:00,380 --> 00:17:04,180
更壮了.
Made you think you were bigger and stronger than any of those monsters.

263
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,620
卢克:真是你唱的?
Luke: You really did that?

264
00:17:06,620 --> 00:17:08,400
乔治:是的,当然.(呻吟)
George: Yeah.Sure.(groaning)

265
00:17:15,660 --> 00:17:18,280
卢克:听我说,迈克告诉我你后背的事了.
Luke: Look, Mike told me what's going on with your back.

266
00:17:18,280 --> 00:17:19,500
乔治:啊,那个小子的舌头可真长啊.
George: Aw, that boy's tongue is loose at both ends.

267
00:17:24,120 --> 00:17:26,500
卢克:你知道,乔治,你必须现在就做决定.
Luke: You know, George, you're going to have to make a decision here.

268
00:17:27,120 --> 00:17:31,100
乔治:我决定了.我不会放弃开车的.我不想再谈这事了.
George: I made one.I'm not gonna quit trucking.I don't wanna talk about.Luke: So you're just gonna pretend like it doesn't exist?You know, that's typical.

269
00:17:31,100 --> 00:17:36,500
卢克:你就这样假装什么事也没发生吗?你总是这样.
Luke: So you're just gonna pretend like it doesn't exist?You know, that's typical.

270
00:17:41,180 --> 00:17:43,560
这就像在过去13年里,所有的事从来都没发生过一样.
Its just like everything that's ever went on in the past thirteen years

271
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:48,120
我想跟你谈谈,乔治.
never happened.I want to talk about it, George.

272
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:49,700
我是说,过了这么长的时间,你突然过来,对我说过去的事就让它过去算了.让我们跳上车,看萤火虫去吧.
I mean, you come here after all this time, and you say what's past is past.Let's jump into a truck and watch the fireflies.

273
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:51,200
乔治:我只是想……
George: What Is was trying....

274
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:55,800
卢克:听着!你给我一张接一张地寄世界上最大笨鸡的明信片.
Luke: Look!You send me postcard after postcard, about the world's biggest prairie chicken.

275
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:59,500
为什么不寄一张写着"对不起,我毁了你的生活"这样的明信片呢?
Well, what about the postcard that says "I'm sorry I ruined your life?"

276
00:17:59,500 --> 00:18:00,000
乔治:卢克……
George: Luke...

277
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:08,520
卢克:你知道,你逃避医生就像逃避所有的事,
Luke: You know, you run from doctors the way you run from everything.

278
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:21,460
包括你自己的儿子.我有什么不对的?
Including your own son.What was wrong with me?

279
00:18:22,700 --> 00:18:24,220
乔治:你有什么不对的?
George: What was wrong with you?

280
00:18:24,220 --> 00:18:28,880
卢克:是.怎么了这是,乔治?你为什么不告诉我呢?
Luke: Yeah.What was it, George?Why can't you just tell me?

281
00:18:30,120 --> 00:18:32,100
乔治:你这个样子,我不能跟你说.
George: I can't talk to you when you're like this.

282
00:18:32,100 --> 00:18:35,600
卢克:你总是那个老样子.我觉得你变不了.
Luke: Then you haven't changed.I don't think you ever will.

283
00:18:41,460 --> 00:18:48,580
乔治:卢克!卢克!
George: Luke!Luke!I'm not very good at this kind of talk.

284
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:54,460
我不知道该怎么说这样的话.如果非要说出来,那我就整个晚上努努力.
But if it's what it takes, I'll keep trying all night.

285
00:18:56,620 --> 00:18:59,940
不过,你先得帮我到厕所里去.
But first, you've got to get me to the bathroom!

286
00:19:00,600 --> 00:19:06,100
杰森:啊哈,你该早点看看我们,麦琪.我们开着车,风吹在脸上,前方是宽敞的道路……
Jason: Ah, you should have seen us, Maggie.There we were, the wind in our faces, the open road before us...

287
00:19:10,700 --> 00:19:12,740
杰森和本:……内裤里满是西红柿.
Jason and Ben: ...and tomatoes in our shorts.

288
00:19:14,520 --> 00:19:16,000
麦琪:哦,嗨,乔治.
Maggie: Oh, hi George.

289
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:16,600
乔治:早上好.这是你们俩吗?谢谢你们帮我把西红柿运到泽西.
George: G'morning.Is that you two?Thanks for running those tomatoes to Jersey for me.

290
00:19:16,600 --> 00:19:18,400
杰森:啊,小意思,乔治.
Jason: Ah, piece of cake, George.

291
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:26,200
乔治:哦,你这么说太好了.有时候,他们故意为难第一次去那里的人,让他们"自己的货自己卸".
George: Oh, glad to hear it.Sometimes they try to pull a fast one on first timers, make 'em unload their own truck.

292
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:28,500
迈克:你今天看起来好多了,乔治.
Mike: You're sure looking a lot better today, George.

293
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:30,900
乔治:哦,是的.呃,我该出门上路了.
George: Uh, yep, uh, about time to hit the road.

294
00:19:30,900 --> 00:19:35,600
迈克:你,呃,你要走吗?那好极了……我是说你身体好多了.
Mike: You, uh, you're leaving?Now that's great....that you're feeling better.

295
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:42,220
乔治:我的背弯的可以看到车轱辘了.
George: My back's loose enough for me to see over the wheel.

296
00:19:42,380 --> 00:19:44,220
我可以一路顺利地到达图森城了.
I should make it to Tucson just fine.

297
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:47,740
迈克:那么你肯定开大卡车是你最好的选择吗?
Mike: So you're sure that driving that big rig is the best thing for you?

298
00:19:47,740 --> 00:19:50,760
乔治:哦,绝对是.
George: Oh, absolutely.As soon as I get there, I'm gonna sell it,

299
00:19:51,160 --> 00:19:53,100
我一到那里,就会把车卖了,然后从一个老朋友那里买个小店铺.
and by myself a truck stop from an old buddy.

300
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:56,180
迈克:你不再开卡车了?
Mike: You're quitting trucking?

301
00:19:57,420 --> 00:20:00,240
乔治:是的,卢克是个很好的年轻说客.
George: Well, Luke's a very persuasive young man.

302
00:20:01,300 --> 00:20:04,840
迈克:哇,卢克.你怎么做到的?你说了什么?
Mike: Wow, Luke.Well, how'd you do it?What'd you say?

303
00:20:13,580 --> 00:20:13,800
卢克:我说我要跟他走.
Luke: I said that I'm going with him.

304
00:20:13,800 --> 00:20:15,200
迈克:什么?
Mike: What?

305
00:20:19,980 --> 00:20:22,340
卢克:只是一两个月而已,迈克.帮他安顿一下.
Luke: It's only for a couple of months, Mike.To help him set up.

306
00:20:23,560 --> 00:20:24,400
迈克:你脑子里塞棉花了吗?别惹我生气.
Mike: Are you out of your cotton-picking mind?No offense.

307
00:20:24,400 --> 00:20:25,200
杰森:迈克,注意.
Jason: Mike, a word.

308
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:32,040
迈克:爸爸,对不起.不过,我不会让他这么做的.
Mike: Dad, I'm sorry, but I can't let him do this.

309
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:35,220
杰森:哦,你只能认了.卢克必须去了解自己的父亲.
Jason: Well, you have to.Luke has to get to know his father.

310
00:20:35,220 --> 00:20:36,400
迈克:爸爸,他,他不能就这样拍屁股走人啊.他的生活怎么办?我们呢?
Mike: Dad, he, he can't just pick up and leave like this.What about his life?What about us?

311
00:20:43,320 --> 00:20:45,180
杰森:迈克,这不是你的决定.
Jason: Mike, this is not your decision.

312
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:58,900
卢克:迈克,你教过我,有人最需要你的时候,
Luke: Mike, you taught me what it means to be there when somebody needs

313
00:20:58,900 --> 00:21:10,840
你必须在他那里.我也想这么对乔治,我指的是我的爸爸.
you the most.And I want to do the same for George.I mean, my dad.

314
00:21:19,180 --> 00:21:20,880
卢克:好了,伙计们,
Luke: Come on, you guys, don't look like that.

315
00:21:20,920 --> 00:21:23,180
别哭丧着脸.只是一两个月而已嘛.我会回来的.
It's only for a couple of months.I'll be coming back.

316
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:30,400
迈克:(叹气)好吧,你一定要回来.
Mike: (sighing) Well, uh, you'd better come back.

317
00:22:30,400 --> 00:22:36,500
卢克:别拦着我了.
Luke: Try and stop me.

318
00:22:36,500 --> 00:22:37,100
麦琪:再见,卢克.
Maggie: Bye, Luke.

319
00:22:37,100 --> 00:22:38,000
杰森:再见,卢克.
克莉丝:再见,卢克.
00:22:38,000
Jason: See you, Luke. Chrissy: Goodbye, Luke.
